    <guid isPermaLink="false">6904d97943a4f4a984545d99</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 31 Oct 2025 15:48:42 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【导语】</span></p><span></span><p><span>她被称为平成三大恶女，她被称为毒妇，她被称为第二个木岛佳苗。</span></p><span></span><p><span>她在打造成功第一期自杀案后，失去了自己的名字。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>kaka</span></p><span></span><p><span>【声音出演】</span></p><span></span><p><span>圆山兄：背叛了长沙塑普的摇滚主唱伍别</span></p><span></span><p><span>圆山弟：一人分饰多角色的长沙塑普主唱伍别</span></p><span></span><p><span>垃圾检验员大姐：刻薄冠军银珠</span></p><span></span><p><span>嚼舌根八卦老乡：斯坦尼斯拉夫斯基体验派表演博士王总</span></p><span></span><p><span>小酒馆爱好者：不会配音的剪辑不是好电影人的蔡老师</span></p><span></span><p><span>朝阳群众老阿姨：真实拥有五个毛孩子的沈姐</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="102">01:42</a> 电器店店主去哪了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="590">09:50</a> 常客</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="893">14:53</a> 八卦的中心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1104">18:24</a> 6个死去的男人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1599">26:39</a> 上田美由纪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1860">31:00</a> 手段</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2340">39:00</a> 罗生门</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2557">42:37</a> 安眠药</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2762">46:02</a> 剧终</span></p><span></span><p><span>【图片信息】</span></p><span></span><p><span>1. 上田美由纪</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FncC2Ne8agHHDjTzDg5M4cCZSlVx.gif"></figure><span></span><p><span>2. 案件时间线</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmYD-eYNLxuqZHfbLF9gT7HjtFhu.gif"></figure><span></span><p><span>3. 上田美由纪的信</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgD1sNr3diEbGFGmjmaKk-wXjGIS.gif"></figure><span></span><p><span>4.上田美由纪的住所</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuGlyCkxM8gaX9yo2PoMkEBTbBAQ.gif"></figure><span></span><p><span>【BGM】</span></p><span></span><p><span>OP：猿の手様 - 蓜島邦明</span></p><span></span><p><span>ED：其实你不懂我的心 - 买辣椒也用券</span></p><span></span><p><span>【参考资料】</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%B3%A5%E5%8F%96%E9%80%A3%E7%B6%9A%E4%B8%8D%E5%AF%A9%E6%AD%BB%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6" data-url="https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%B3%A5%E5%8F%96%E9%80%A3%E7%B6%9A%E4%B8%8D%E5%AF%A9%E6%AD%BB%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6"><u><span>ja.wikipedia.org鳥取連続不審死事件</span></u></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.ntv.co.jp/gyoten/backnumber/article/20171219_06.html" data-url="https://www.ntv.co.jp/gyoten/backnumber/article/20171219_06.html"><u><span>www.ntv.co.jp</span></u></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://bunshun.jp/articles/-/76018#goog_rewarded" data-url="https://bunshun.jp/articles/-/76018#goog_rewarded"><u><span>bunshun.jp</span></u></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uC9lVdowkaY" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uC9lVdowkaY"><u><span>www.youtube.com</span></u></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XIY5uOVwaLk" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XIY5uOVwaLk"><u><span>www.youtube.com</span></u></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vmxf2Z_NQ88" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vmxf2Z_NQ88"><u><span>www.youtube.com</span></u></a></p>]]></description>
