    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【导语】</span></p><span></span><p><span>一通自首电话，拉开了案件的序幕。</span></p><span></span><p><span>与平常的报警电话不同，报案人没有惊慌失措，没有语无伦次。</span></p><span></span><p><span>他不疾不徐，条理清晰清晰地告知了警方，就在刚刚，他杀死了自己的儿子。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>kaka 小陈</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="115">01:55</a> 相距20年的共同生活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="540">09:00</a> 虎父</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="831">13:51</a> 犬子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1680">28:00</a> 离开的妹妹</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1979">32:59</a> 父与子的最后5天</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2540">42:20</a> 主播的左右互搏</span></p><span></span><p><span>【图片信息】</span></p><span></span><p><span>1.案发地熊泽家</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq13-t4IFtsrq8-F5hmx7yKPnCnR.gif"></figure><span></span><p><span>2.熊泽英昭</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cDovL3AxLm11c2ljLjEyNi5uZXQvMDdqcEhfclE1X1BFNl9pZ3VBREVGdz09LzEwOTk1MTE3MTMzMTQ4MzUwNS5qcGc="></p><span></span><p><span>3.推测是熊泽英一郎的推特账号</span><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cDovL3AxLm11c2ljLjEyNi5uZXQvd0xjTUFlTGV3SkVzMzZabndqQ2dYUT09LzEwOTk1MTE3MTMzMTQ4MDI0Ny5qcGc="></p><span></span><p><span>【BGM】</span></p><span></span><p><span>OP：猿の手様 - 蓜島邦明</span></p><span></span><p><span>ED：PG家长指引 - 陈奕迅</span></p><span></span><p><span>【参考资料】</span></p><span></span><p><span>www.youtube.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>bunshun.jp</span></p><span></span><p><span>ja.wikipedia.org</span></p><span></span><p><span>www.bengo4.com</span></p>]]></description>
