    <title>Vol.21 护士节特辑：被诅咒的医院四楼 - 横滨大口医院连续杀人事件</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6820af9224f85593460bae96</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6820af9224f85593460bae96</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 11 May 2025 14:10:19 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【导语】</span></p><span></span><p><span>医院，当这个地方出现死亡，大家都会强迫自己接受。而2016年，一位88岁老人的寿终正寝，却牵扯出医院里隐藏的杀人恶魔。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在安全的保护色下，日本犯罪史上异例的杀人魔出现了。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>kaka 初初</span></p><span></span><p><span>【特别鸣谢】</span></p><span></span><p><span>护士A：顾姐</span></p><span></span><p><span>护士B：小陈</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="141">02:21</a> 被诅咒的四楼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1024">17:04</a> 奇异的泡沫</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1281">21:21</a> 不该出现的消毒水</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1456">24:16</a> 包走消毒水的人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1880">31:20</a> 成为护士的理由和杀人的理由</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3120">52:00</a> 抑郁症第一名的职业</span></p><span></span><p><span>【图片信息】</span></p><span></span><p><span>1. 久保木爱弓</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnfAVaVvT5nTMfRtmWGiissdvrgl.gif"></figure><span></span><p><span>2.大口医院旧址</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhjV0V2PsRBmE5qaJ_B7V8mwumw5.gif"></figure><span></span><p><span>3.事发时院长道歉新闻图</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FveDWWeeG8Vt4N-ezPYP9oEWfNXn.gif"></figure><span></span><p><span>【BGM】</span></p><span></span><p><span>OP：猿の手様 - 蓜島邦明</span></p><span></span><p><span>ED：泡沫 - 邓紫棋</span></p><span></span><p><span>【参考资料】</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mbqh6yZTF-4" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mbqh6yZTF-4"><span>www.youtube.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A4%A7%E5%8F%A3%E7%97%85%E9%99%A2%E9%80%A3%E7%B6%9A%E7%82%B9%E6%BB%B4%E4%B8%AD%E6%AF%92%E6%AD%BB%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6" data-url="https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A4%A7%E5%8F%A3%E7%97%85%E9%99%A2%E9%80%A3%E7%B6%9A%E7%82%B9%E6%BB%B4%E4%B8%AD%E6%AF%92%E6%AD%BB%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6"><span>ja.wikipedia.org</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://bunshun.jp/articles/-/49541" data-url="https://bunshun.jp/articles/-/49541"><span>bunshun.jp</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://bunshun.jp/articles/-/49095" data-url="https://bunshun.jp/articles/-/49095"><span>bunshun.jp</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www3.nhk.or.jp/news/html/20240619/k10014485641000.html" data-url="https://www3.nhk.or.jp/news/html/20240619/k10014485641000.html"><span>www3.nhk.or.jp</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%A8%AA%E6%B5%9C%E3%81%AF%E3%81%98%E3%82%81%E7%97%85%E9%99%A2" data-url="https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%A8%AA%E6%B5%9C%E3%81%AF%E3%81%98%E3%82%81%E7%97%85%E9%99%A2"><span>ja.wikipedia.org</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://fukushi.tv/media/mental-disorder/job-ranking/" data-url="https://fukushi.tv/media/mental-disorder/job-ranking/"><span>fukushi.tv</span></a></p>]]></description>
