    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【导语】</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果人生走入绝境，该如何重启人生。有人改过自新，有人拼搏努力，有人重选赛道，有人却选择替代别人，重过别人的人生。</span></p><span></span><p><span>“你永远也不会知道，那些生活中看似和你亲密的人，会在背后对你抱有多大的恶意。”</span></p><span></span><p><span>by 东野圭吾《恶意》</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>kaka 小陈</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="105">01:45</a> 消失的她</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="845">14:05</a> 老同学</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1072">17:52</a> 逃出升天</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1215">20:15</a> 重启人生前的人生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2345">39:05</a> 漂洋过海</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2685">44:45</a> 最后的审判</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2894">48:14</a> 没用的知识增加了</span></p><span></span><p><span>【图片信息】</span></p><span></span><p><span>1. 弃尸的仓库</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FidjGd94hxSlmBZPkNzdEf1JN-xF.gif"></figure><span></span><p><span>2. 大石尤莉</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fle6FGFPP90GvKyQp61UpPGpQ18k.gif"></figure><span></span><p><span>【BGM】</span></p><span></span><p><span>OP：猿の手様 - 蓜島邦明</span></p><span></span><p><span>ED：我们的纪念册 - Twins</span></p><span></span><p><span>【参考资料】</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OBqdNIBwzhc" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OBqdNIBwzhc"><u><span>www.youtube.com</span></u></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://hashigozakura.wordpress.com/tag/%E5%A4%A7%E7%9F%B3%E3%82%86%E3%82%8A%E5%AE%B9%E7%96%91%E8%80%85%EF%BC%8829%EF%BC%89%EF%BD%9C%E5%87%86%E7%9C%8B%E8%AD%B7%E5%B8%AB%E6%AD%BB%E4%BD%93%E9%81%BA%E6%A3%84%E5%AE%B9%E7%96%91/" data-url="https://hashigozakura.wordpress.com/tag/%E5%A4%A7%E7%9F%B3%E3%82%86%E3%8