    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【导语】</span></p><span></span><p><span>安静的住宅楼内，母女三人横尸于自己家中，男主人因工作逃过一劫。是什么样的深仇大恨引发的这起差点灭门的惨案，所有的源头均来自一架钢琴。</span></p><span></span><p><span>而本应安抚人心的钢琴曲，这一次却夺人性命。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>kaka 小陈</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="110">01:50</a> 母女三人陈尸家中</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="443">07:23</a> 一丝凶手行踪成迷</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="794">13:14</a> 自首自述身体障碍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2035">33:55</a> 矛盾激增</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2293">38:13</a> 案发当天戛然而止的钢琴音</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2530">42:10</a> 争议的审判</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2910">48:30</a> 感想 &amp; 幸福者退让原则</span></p><span></span><p><span>【图片信息】</span></p><span></span><p><span>1. 大浜松三</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvKJwv2UOE-hEq5VCmVI-bSv_Vkn.gif"></figure><span></span><p><span>2.事发住宅楼</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrQv0cg6gKZbJ-hpG_gVWX8Cnp_h.gif"></figure><span></span><p><span>3.事发时室内状况图</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Flwhn9HylhjRXoktY072QltV69h5.gif"></figure><span></span><p><span>【BGM】</span></p><span></span><p><span>OP：猿の手様 - 蓜島邦明</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM1：车尔尼599</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM2：第二钢琴协奏曲第二乐章 - 拉赫玛尼诺夫</span></p><span></span><p><span>ED：梦幻曲 - 罗伯特·舒曼 《童年情景》15之7</span></p><span></span><p><span>【参考资料】</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XrZ4OkHB0HM" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XrZ4OkHB0HM"><u><span>www.youtube.com</span></u></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%83%94%E3%82%A2%E3%83%8E%E9%A8%92%E9%9F%B3%E6%AE%BA%E4%BA%BA%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6" data-url="https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%83%94%E3%82%A2%E3%83%8E%E9%A8%92%E9%9F%B3%E6%AE%BA%E4%BA%BA%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6"><u><span>ja.wikipedia.org</span></u></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://ameblo.jp/rinaogawa1994/entry-12818941377.html" data-url="https://ameblo.jp/rinaogawa1994/entry-12818941377.html"><u><span>ameblo.jp</span></u></a></p>]]></description>
