  <item>
    <title>Vol.18 黑制服系列：杀完人后你敢上电视吗？ - 胜田清孝事件</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/678dcf0e9420ede9d146b030</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">678dcf0e9420ede9d146b030</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 20 Jan 2025 04:44:25 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【导语】</span></p><span></span><p><span>1983年1月31日，发生了一起银行取款男子遭袭击的事件。由于男子进行反击，犯人被制服并逮捕，但随后警方发现了一个令人震惊的事实——这个犯人，胜田清孝，正是过去十年来一直让社会震动的连环杀人犯。</span></p><span></span><p><span>他是令人尊敬的烈火英雄，但他也可以杀完人后，坦然的上电视出现在公众面前。</span></p><span></span><p><span>10余年间，胜田清孝共杀害22人，其余相关案件300多起，他被称为日本20世纪最后的死刑犯。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>kaka 猫喝水</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="135">02:15</a> 连环杀人魔出现</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="260">04:20</a> 剑走偏锋的成长期</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="833">13:53</a> 赌一个浪子回头</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1153">19:13</a> 消防员生涯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2540">42:20</a> 从偷抢到劫杀</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3730">62:10</a> 历时10年的逮捕</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4070">67:50</a> 关于迷之精神状态的讨论</span></p><span></span><p><span>【图片信息】</span></p><span></span><p><span>1. 胜田清孝电视节目画面</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp6ZeW61P-7aFSy_4duFpSCgOU8t.gif"></figure><span></span><p><span>2. 被捕画面</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsGBOobP5vYRVkNrS_lw0ey2VZ3H.gif"></figure><span></span><p><span>3.狱中信件出版成书</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fkjqxm_akRRhVax2Me5mUhpXcRbG.gif"></figure><span></span><p><span>【BGM】</span></p><span></span><p><span>OP：猿の手様 - 蓜島邦明</span></p><span></span><p><span>ED：抽帧 - 裘德</span></p><span></span><p><span>【参考资料】</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://guardians7.com/katuta-kiyotaka/" data-url="https://guardians7.com/katuta-kiyotaka/"><u><span>guardians7.com</span></u></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yo261FrTTuI" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yo261FrTTuI"><u><span>www.youtube.com</span></u></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%8B%9D%E7%94%B0%E6%B8%85%E5%AD%9D%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6" data-url="https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%8B%9D%E7%94%B0%E6%B8%85%E5%AD%9D%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6"><u><span>ja.wikipedia.org</span></u></a></p><span></span><p><a href="http://www.maroon.dti.ne.jp/knight999/katuta.htm" data-url="http://www.maroon.dti.ne.jp/knight999/katuta.htm"><u><span>www.maroon.dti.ne.jp</span></u></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.pref.wakayama.lg.jp/prefg/500300/koushi/d00157274_d/fil/R2chikouhou.pdf" data-url="https://www.pref.wakayama.lg.jp/prefg/500300/koushi/d00157274_d/fil/R2chikouhou.pdf"><u><span>www.pref.wakayama.lg.jp</span></u></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://tfd-saiyo.jp/assets/pdf/tfd_recruit_guide_senmon_1rui.pdf" data-url="https://tfd-saiyo.jp/assets/pdf/tfd_recruit_guide_senmon_1rui.pdf"><u><span>tfd-saiyo.jp</span></u></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20181016143551/https:/blog.goo.ne.jp/kanayame_47/e/46fb70eae93b1274b9a9fe9ca161ebc8" data-url="https://web.archive.org/web/20181016143551/https:/blog.goo.ne.jp/kanayame_47/e/46fb70eae93b1274b9a9fe9ca161ebc8"><u><span>web.archive.org</span></u></a></p>]]></description>
