    <guid isPermaLink="false">677aab8515a5fd520e3c5177</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 05 Jan 2025 17:36:37 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【导语】</span></p><span></span><p><span>深夜的东京都多摩川，一只被打捞起的黑色行李箱，行李箱中蜷缩的尸体，是一位走红网络的无赖系网红。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们通过警察的视线，看到一个网红生活中复杂交错的矛盾与利益，死亡也带来了一次变了味儿的网络狂欢。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>kaka 小陈</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="113">01:53</a> 多摩川里的行李箱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="277">04:37</a> 成为网红前的原唯之</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="647">10:47</a> 网红唯我</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="872">14:32</a> 网红之战</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1176">19:36</a> 正义网友之战</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1339">22:19</a> 榜一大哥泷泽秀明</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1573">26:13</a> 网络狂欢</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1950">32:30</a> 真凶浮出水面</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2648">44:08</a> kaka和小陈一些无法理解但算了的事</span></p><span></span><p><span>【图片信息】</span></p><span></span><p><span>1. 泷泽秀明空降原唯之直播画面</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg5pSAca8DvCYymHXtbbObhcPi6Y.gif"></figure><span></span><p><span>2.原唯之坐豪车自嘲图</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj4_UXMSyRay_ZZvgRjGHd3IIeeH.gif"></figure><span></span><p><span>3.西高舞</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrWSfWX1vOQ5AdZoO7_bw36yRab6.gif"></figure><span></span><p><span>4.犯罪关系图</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqnNkeVkQYIXgyQjlrfrftQ_l-M6.gif"></figure><span></span><p><span>【BGM】</span></p><span></span><p><span>OP：猿の手様 - 蓜島邦明</span></p><span></span><p><span>ED：无赖 - 郑中基</span></p><span></span><p><span>【参考资料】</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zyJy4tjB5VE" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zyJy4tjB5VE"><u><span>www.youtube.com</span></u></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://leather-no-wabisabi.com/yuiga-hanzai/" data-url="https://leather-no-wabisabi.com/yuiga-hanzai/"><u><span>leather-no-wabisabi.com</span></u></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://ameblo.jp/shukanshincho/entry-12837007606.html" data-url="https://ameblo.jp/shukanshincho/entry-12837007606.html"><u><span>ameblo.jp</span></u></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.mag2.com/p/news/599871" data-url="https://www.mag2.com/p/news/599871"><u><span>www.mag2.com</span></u></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://newsmatomedia.com/yuiga" data-url="https://newsmatomedia.com/yuiga"><u><span>newsmatomedia.com</span></u></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.fnn.jp/articles/-/704911?display=full" data-url="https://www.fnn.jp/articles/-/704911?display=full"><u><span>www.fnn.jp</span></u></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://bunshun.jp/articles/-/71038" data-url="https://bunshun.jp/articles/-/71038"><u><span>bunshun.jp</span></u></a></p>]]></description>
