    <pubDate>Mon, 09 Dec 2024 11:42:50 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【导语】</span></p><span></span><p><span>清早6点，一位女性突然接到了大学生孙子的电话，电话中他只说了一句：“给我毛毯”。这句意味不明的话这也是他留在人世间的最后一句话。</span></p><span></span><p><span>死者死因来自体内的多种药剂导致的昏迷溺水。而这重重保障的杀人计划，起点竟然是因为一个小到不能再小的，虚荣的谎言。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>kaka 小陈</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="130">02:10</a> 最后的一通电话</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="545">09:05</a> 犯人出现</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="978">16:18</a> 一段在谎言上建立的友情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1935">32:15</a> 第一次谋杀和第二次谋杀</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2280">38:00</a> 想不通のkaka 和 黑化の小陈</span></p><span></span><p><span>【图片信息】</span></p><span></span><p><span>1. 山本胜博</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtjZ36ptwsi992kaRUqlS8kMqpLC.gif"></figure><span></span><p><span>【BGM】</span></p><span></span><p><span>OP：猿の手様 - 蓜島邦明</span></p><span></span><p><span>ED：最佳损友 - 陈奕迅</span></p><span></span><p><span>【参考资料】</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0HA-v-QDYJ0" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0HA-v-QDYJ0"><u><span>www.youtube.com</span></u></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.ntv.co.jp/gyoten/articles/324xurtv1uiocgr7od0.html" data-url="https://www.ntv.co.jp/gyoten/articles/324xurtv1uiocgr7od0.html"><u><span>www.ntv.co.jp</span></u></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=viDX-5qfi5M" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=viDX-5qfi5M"><u><span>www.youtube.com</span></u></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.sankei.com/article/20160220-2KGV26BZJ5IC7NBR34J2P7MLSU/" data-url="https://www.sankei.com/article/20160220-2KGV26BZJ5IC7NBR34J2P7MLSU/"><u><span>www.sankei.com</span></u></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://detail.chiebukuro.yahoo.co.jp/qa/question_detail/q11156052481" data-url="https://detail.chiebukuro.yahoo.co.jp/qa/question_detail/q11156052481"><u><span>detail.chiebukuro.yahoo.co.jp</span></u></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://hiroshimareport.com/blog-entry-2226.html" data-url="https://hiroshimareport.com/blog-entry-2226.html"><u><span>hiroshimareport.com</span></u></a></p>]]></description>
