  <item>
    <title>Vol.14 黑制服系列：7号恋人 - 大阪府警杀人事件</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/674c78880ed328720ab3e6c4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">674c78880ed328720ab3e6c4</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 02 Dec 2024 13:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【导语】</span></p><span></span><p><span>制服，是一个群体的象征。</span></p><span></span><p><span>或代表专业，或代表权威，有时候代表正义。</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果代表正义的人，开始行不义之事，身上的制服变成他的保护伞，同时也是他的耻辱柱。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期的黑色制服，脚踏7只船，混乱的男女关系无法平衡的时候，他选择让产生问题的人消失。</span></p><span></span><p><span>受害者被亲密的爱人背刺，同时也被信任的正义背刺。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>kaka 猫喝水</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="163">02:43</a> 故事的开始</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="644">10:44</a> 奇怪的恋爱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1177">19:37</a> 原来只是7号恋人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1515">25:15</a> 案发</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1737">28:57</a> 黑制服浮出水面</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2043">34:03</a> 让我们有所保留的对职业产生滤镜吧</span></p><span></span><p><span>【图片信息】</span></p><span></span><p><span>1.水内贵士</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtpaPLCIWpWbNUIlOe2b3bZTaHFM.gif"></figure><span></span><p><span>2. 脸书上的结婚照</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh3vEteA6pVkHZ7OGNr-T27oicD4.gif"></figure><span></span><p><span>【BGM】</span></p><span></span><p><span>OP：猿の手様 - 蓜島邦明</span></p><span></span><p><span>ED：16号爱人 - 容祖儿</span></p><span></span><p><span>【参考资料】</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6yLtuUNcTTU" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6yLtuUNcTTU"><span>www.youtube.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://ameblo.jp/2750-0405/entry-12804614195.html" data-url="https://ameblo.jp/2750-0405/entry-12804614195.html"><span>ameblo.jp</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sKY3Dt7_7Nc" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sKY3Dt7_7Nc"><span>www.youtube.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="http://tm-lab.a.la9.jp/life/past-hitorigoto/hitorigoto_15-03.pdf" data-url="http://tm-lab.a.la9.jp/life/past-hitorigoto/hitorigoto_15-03.pdf"><span>tm-lab.a.la9.jp</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.sankei.com/article/20150814-GDPW6SDNWVNY3BMOY4WVCYYVWA/" data-url="https://www.sankei.com/article/20150814-GDPW6SDNWVNY3BMOY4WVCYYVWA/"><span>www.sankei.com</span></a></p>]]></description>
