  <item>
    <title>Vol.13 “怨灵的复仇” - 島根县大学生抛尸案</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67448c4411045e78e5d874cc</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67448c4411045e78e5d874cc</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 25 Nov 2024 14:57:53 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【导语】</span></p><span></span><p><span>“对嫌疑人做不起诉处理。”</span></p><span></span><p><span>这是法院做出的最终判决。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这起案件性质恶劣，手法凶残，在日本国内引起了高度的关注。警方手握关键性证据，但对嫌疑人不起诉，而这一判决并没有引起民众的愤怒。</span></p><span></span><p><span>因为，嫌疑人已经受到应有的判决了。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>kaka 小陈</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="100">01:40</a> 崭新的大学生活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="229">03:49</a> 失踪的夜晚</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="568">09:28</a> 尸体发现</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="767">12:47</a> 案件进入迷宫</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1634">27:14</a> 终于抓住了凶手的小尾巴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1840">30:40</a> “抓不住”的凶手</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2680">44:40</a> 比起灵异故事，更希望是童话故事</span></p><span></span><p><span>【图片信息】</span></p><span></span><p><span>1.警方卧龙山抛尸地搜查中</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ftnref7us10F74BWwrsEBhMQyLpT.gif"></figure><span></span><p><span>2.疑似灵异采访视频画面</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgKC4ouQc-aKtiiHG_crmOhPSvm_.gif"></figure><span></span><p><span>3.矢野富荣mixi账号头像</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhqEKIkE_JG0pCO1u24Axy__2Cbb.gif"></figure><span></span><p><span>4. 矢野富荣</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuzLaCObk20coiJ3MVh37xe1LyOo.gif"></figure><span></span><p><span>【BGM】</span></p><span></span><p><span>OP：猿の手様 - 蓜島邦明</span></p><span></span><p><span>ED：今晚 - 陈婧霏</span></p><span></span><p><span>【参考资料】</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%B3%B6%E6%A0%B9%E5%A5%B3%E5%AD%90%E5%A4%A7%E7%94%9F%E6%AD%BB%E4%BD%93%E9%81%BA%E6%A3%84%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6" data-url="https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%B3%B6%E6%A0%B9%E5%A5%B3%E5%AD%90%E5%A4%A7%E7%94%9F%E6%AD%BB%E4%BD%93%E9%81%BA%E6%A3%84%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6"><u><span>ja.wikipedia.org</span></u></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8O7HnhanFhM" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8O7HnhanFhM"><u><span>www.youtube.com</span></u></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ztkbh1qTIlM" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ztkbh1qTIlM"><u><span>www.youtube.com</span></u></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ync7PT4sC04" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ync7PT4sC04"><u><span>www.youtube.com</span></u></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://kwsklife.com/shaman-abandoned/" data-url="https://kwsklife.com/shaman-abandoned/"><u><span>kwsklife.com</span></u></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://bunshun.jp/articles/-/56319" data-url="https://bunshun.jp/articles/-/56319"><u><span>bunshun.jp</span></u></a></p>]]></description>
