    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【导语】</span></p><span></span><p><span>一本来自被害者的日记本，一只被害者常戴的手表，一封来自凶手的死亡预告。</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你收到这样的恐怖快递，你会怎么办？</span></p><span></span><p><span>这起案件中这个包裹的收件人表面慌张，内心却淡然。</span></p><span></span><p><span>她很笃定自己不会有事，因为这是她发给自己的死亡预告。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>kaka 小陈</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="108">01:48</a> 案件发现</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="431">07:11</a> 寻找被害人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="956">15:56</a> 真凶浮出水面</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1260">21:00</a> 追溯杀人动机</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2280">38:00</a> 试图理解加害人，未遂</span></p><span></span><p><span>【图片信息】</span></p><span></span><p><span>1.江田文子被逮捕现场</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq92YIWvTCYSv1rMiXeRXqxvCPUN.gif"></figure><span></span><p><span>2.江田（城户）文子在狱中出的书</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fog52LIpRClHcD4xnA4rewnq6Vwe.gif"></figure><span></span><p><span>3.抛尸轨迹</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg5qUw837wAwUSNwrCZtaPLZTKSk.gif"></figure><span></span><p><span>【BGM】</span></p><span></span><p><span>OP：猿の手様 - 蓜島邦明</span></p><span></span><p><span>ED：易燃易爆炸 - 陈粒</span></p><span></span><p><span>【参考资料】</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2cmkhvUu4HI" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2cmkhvUu4HI"><u><span>www.youtube.com</span></u></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GXooSf2IkKA" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GXooSf2IkKA"><u><span>www.youtube.com</span></u></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%A6%8F%E5%B2%A1%E7%BE%8E%E5%AE%B9%E5%B8%AB%E3%83%90%E3%83%A9%E3%83%90%E3%83%A9%E6%AE%BA%E4%BA%BA%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6" data-url="https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%A6%8F%E5%B2%A1%E7%BE%8E%E5%AE%B9%E5%B8%AB%E3%83%90%E3%83%A9%E3%83%90%E3%83%A9%E6%AE%BA%E4%BA%BA%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6"><u><span>ja.wikipedia.org</span></u></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://sumiretanpopoaoibara.hatenablog.com/entry/2022/11/04/053234" data-url="https://sumiretanpopoaoibara.hatenablog.com/entry/2022/11/04/053234"><u><span>sumiretanpopoaoibara.hatenablog.com</span></u></a></p>]]></description>
